1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by
monitoring Akamaru?</font>

32
00:01:35,450 --> 00:01:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know about the incident</font>

33
00:01:37,410 --> 00:01:40,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where someone from outside
infiltrated the village, right?</font>

34
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I know about that.</font>

35
00:01:42,580 --> 00:01:46,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I heard that Kiba and the others
resolved that incident without trouble.</font>

36
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:47,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

37
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! That Kiba!</font>

38
00:01:52,550 --> 00:01:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want a mission where
I totally kick an enemy's butt.</font>

39
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be exact, that's wrong.</font>

40
00:01:58,010 --> 00:01:58,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

41
00:01:59,050 --> 00:02:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before Kiba and the others
had the intruder in custody...</font>

42
00:02:01,850 --> 00:02:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he swallowed a pellet
and killed himself.</font>

43
00:02:03,770 --> 00:02:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Suicide...?</font>

44
00:02:05,770 --> 00:02:07,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the investigation that followed,</font>

45
00:02:07,190 --> 00:02:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it was revealed that the enemy
was a Shinobi</font>

46
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from another land that uses
a unique tactic.</font>

47
00:02:11,810 --> 00:02:17,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps he took his own life
in order to seal that power.</font>

48
00:02:19,570 --> 00:02:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the "unique" tactic?</font>

49
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:26,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something you would call
a biological weapon.</font>

50
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:29,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Biological weapon?</font>

51
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:33,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a particular pathogen...</font>

52
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:37,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a terrible weapon where someone
infected will gradually lose oneself</font>

53
00:02:37,590 --> 00:02:40,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and have their body taken over.</font>

54
00:02:41,260 --> 00:02:44,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But how is that connected
with monitoring Akamaru?</font>

55
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that Akamaru was...?!</font>

56
00:02:53,230 --> 00:02:55,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a possibility he's infected.</font>

57
00:03:07,250 --> 00:03:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He still doesn't look so well.</font>

58
00:03:10,210 --> 00:03:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

59
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:14,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since Akamaru's not
in his best condition,</font>

60
00:03:14,710 --> 00:03:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm skipping training today as well.</font>

61
00:03:17,550 --> 00:03:18,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

62
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Shino?!</font>

63
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino, do something quick!</font>

64
00:03:44,950 --> 00:03:45,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino!</font>

65
00:03:55,130 --> 00:03:58,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The insects suddenly
stopped listening to me.</font>

66
00:03:58,420 --> 00:04:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, give me a break.</font>

67
00:04:01,130 --> 00:04:01,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.</font>

68
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll head back early
for the time being. See ya.</font>

69
00:04:08,970 --> 00:04:11,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope... Akamaru gets better soon.</font>

70
00:04:13,810 --> 00:04:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino?</font>

71
00:04:15,940 --> 00:04:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the first time the insects
have attacked a comrade...</font>

72
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:28,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Akamaru?</font>

73
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, shoot! I've been spotted!</font>

74
00:04:36,630 --> 00:04:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Naruto?</font>

75
00:04:38,590 --> 00:04:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, you ask?</font>

76
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:44,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm developing a new Jutsu!</font>

77
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:47,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So as for me, I'm busy and...</font>

78
00:04:54,610 --> 00:04:59,580
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Inuzuka Kiba's Long Day</font>

79
00:05:13,370 --> 00:05:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there no mistake, Sis?</font>

80
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:19,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd say the possibility
at this point is around fifty-fifty.</font>

81
00:05:21,750 --> 00:05:24,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I still haven't been able to identify it,</font>

82
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:27,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but these are the lab results of
the blood drawn from Akamaru...</font>

83
00:05:28,090 --> 00:05:30,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But! It could be some kind of mistake!</font>

84
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:35,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think I, a veterinarian,
would make such a mistake?</font>

85
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:39,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... You're right.</font>

86
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Akamaru?!</font>

87
00:05:50,490 --> 00:05:52,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let go! Let go!</font>

88
00:05:53,450 --> 00:05:56,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru, it's Naruto. It's okay to let go.</font>

89
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:01,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Akamaru!</font>

90
00:06:02,590 --> 00:06:03,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru!</font>

91
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you do that for Akamaru?</font>

92
00:06:11,390 --> 00:06:14,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, what're you doing
in the front yard of my house?</font>

93
00:06:16,180 --> 00:06:18,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's...</font>

94
00:06:19,020 --> 00:06:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, come in.</font>

95
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the time being, I have to fulfill
my responsibility as the owner.</font>

96
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

97
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

98
00:06:29,570 --> 00:06:34,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez! Biting a comrade
of the same village can't be allowed!</font>

99
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you training him properly, Kiba?!</font>

100
00:06:41,830 --> 00:06:42,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

101
00:06:42,670 --> 00:06:45,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finished!
Perfect, if I do say so myself!</font>

102
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:57,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sis! That looks just like
a surgical scar!</font>

103
00:06:57,310 --> 00:07:01,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Really?
I thought it turned out well, though...</font>

104
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:03,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, Naruto.</font>

105
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have Sakura or someone
patch them up for you!</font>

106
00:07:05,650 --> 00:07:06,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

107
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— See ya.
— Right.</font>

108
00:07:10,450 --> 00:07:12,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later too, Miss Hana!</font>

109
00:07:21,790 --> 00:07:22,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

110
00:07:26,210 --> 00:07:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you,</font>

111
00:07:27,170 --> 00:07:30,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's nothing else other than
my pants getting all torn up.</font>

112
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:35,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino's insects attacked Akamaru...</font>

113
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:38,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He even attacked Naruto,
whom he should know very well.</font>

114
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:44,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's trouble, Tsunade-sama!</font>

115
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:56,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they were attacked
by someone</font>

116
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:58,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the middle of night training.</font>

117
00:07:58,910 --> 00:08:01,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like they launched
a sneak attack with quite a few men.</font>

118
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:04,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it seems there was just one culprit.</font>

119
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! All of this by one person?!</font>

120
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be precise, that's not correct.</font>

121
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:15,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's one animal.</font>

122
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no doubt.</font>

123
00:08:20,730 --> 00:08:21,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's trouble, Kiba!</font>

124
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're talking about the incident</font>

125
00:08:23,890 --> 00:08:26,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where Shinobi were attacked during
night training last night, right...?</font>

126
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be!</font>

127
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:31,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems it's as you said, Sis...</font>

128
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:33,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can smell blood from Akamaru.</font>

129
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:51,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Inuzuka Kiba's
Ninja Hound Akamaru, correct?</font>

130
00:08:52,090 --> 00:08:54,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerks.
What do you want with Akamaru?!</font>

131
00:08:57,090 --> 00:08:57,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A warrant...?</font>

132
00:08:58,510 --> 00:08:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba...!</font>

133
00:08:59,810 --> 00:09:01,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, there's no mistake.</font>

134
00:09:02,310 --> 00:09:05,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inuzuka Kiba, by order of the Hokage,</font>

135
00:09:05,350 --> 00:09:07,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Ninja Hound Akamaru is to be kept</font>

136
00:09:07,730 --> 00:09:09,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">under the supervision
of the ANBU Black Ops.</font>

137
00:09:14,610 --> 00:09:16,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Damn it!
— Kiba!</font>

138
00:09:17,450 --> 00:09:20,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should obey
the Hokage-sama's order.</font>

139
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

140
00:09:37,470 --> 00:09:38,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

141
00:09:43,270 --> 00:09:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

142
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:47,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks, Sis.</font>

143
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:50,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This contains medicine that I prepared,</font>

144
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so give it to the vet over there.</font>

145
00:09:53,650 --> 00:09:55,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. I'm off, then.</font>

146
00:10:19,180 --> 00:10:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...?</font>

147
00:10:21,850 --> 00:10:25,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the idea of Akamaru
being detained?!</font>

148
00:10:25,930 --> 00:10:28,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru is the culprit from
last night's incident.</font>

149
00:10:28,890 --> 00:10:30,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have sufficient proof as well.</font>

150
00:10:30,690 --> 00:10:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this point,
it's an unavoidable measure.</font>

151
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:38,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Medical Team is now desperately
looking for a way to save Akamaru.</font>

152
00:10:39,410 --> 00:10:40,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry too much.</font>

153
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:44,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If... that doesn't work either,
what'll happen to Akamaru?</font>

154
00:10:46,330 --> 00:10:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time...</font>

155
00:10:48,330 --> 00:10:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there'll be nothing left to do
but to put Akamaru down!</font>

156
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:53,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"HIDDEN LEAF VETERINARY HOSPITAL"</b></font>

157
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to worry.</font>

158
00:10:55,500 --> 00:10:57,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Medical Corps will figure
something out soon.</font>

159
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

160
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:00,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take care on your way home.</font>

161
00:11:01,590 --> 00:11:02,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

162
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

163
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't hand you over to anyone.</font>

164
00:11:15,610 --> 00:11:18,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems Inuzuka Kiba
has taken Akamaru and fled.</font>

165
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, what shall we do?</font>

166
00:11:21,950 --> 00:11:24,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In preparation for the worst,</font>

167
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have the Special Pursuit Corps
stand by here!</font>

168
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:28,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Special Pursuit Corps...</font>

169
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:32,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that you're really
going to kill Akamaru... Grandma?</font>

170
00:11:35,290 --> 00:11:36,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade!</font>

171
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:40,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's hard for me, too.</font>

172
00:11:45,390 --> 00:11:46,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

173
00:11:50,310 --> 00:11:51,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you find them?!</font>

174
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:52,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

175
00:11:53,770 --> 00:11:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

176
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

177
00:12:05,490 --> 00:12:07,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's rapidly getting worse.</font>

178
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:10,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru!</font>

179
00:12:11,750 --> 00:12:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are they?</font>

180
00:12:12,870 --> 00:12:14,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They should be around here.</font>

181
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:24,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I swore to protect him,
no matter what!</font>

182
00:12:27,260 --> 00:12:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I swore never I'd never let him go through
that experience ever again...!</font>

183
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:41,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Special Pursuit Corps
has assembled.</font>

184
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Show the team in.</font>

185
00:12:50,950 --> 00:12:51,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

186
00:12:52,370 --> 00:12:53,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are you?!</font>

187
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I was able to hide
my tracks somewhat...</font>

188
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:23,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a serum for Akamaru
that the Medical Corps whipped up.</font>

189
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't guarantee the level of effect.</font>

190
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's maybe a 50 percent chance
of survival.</font>

191
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's also a risk of side-effects</font>

192
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:35,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that would cause Akamaru
to go even more berserk.</font>

193
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the event that happens...</font>

194
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an unavoidable measure,
but Akamaru must...</font>

195
00:13:44,380 --> 00:13:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reporting!</font>

196
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:50,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Akamaru Pursuit Corps has
lost the trail of Kiba and Akamaru.</font>

197
00:13:50,470 --> 00:13:51,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama.</font>

198
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:08,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That way?!</font>

199
00:14:09,910 --> 00:14:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

200
00:14:11,370 --> 00:14:12,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

201
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

202
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:25,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Akamaru...</font>

203
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:26,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

204
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:30,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't hand over Akamaru to anyone!</font>

205
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:32,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?!</font>

206
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:35,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you come to kill Akamaru?!</font>

207
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:38,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! I just came out of concern!</font>

208
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:41,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You lie! The Hokage-sama said it,
didn't she?!</font>

209
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There'll be nothing else to do
but to kill Akamaru.</font>

210
00:14:49,450 --> 00:14:52,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You came to dispose of Akamaru, right?!</font>

211
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:55,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't hand over Akamaru
to anyone!</font>

212
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:58,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the time
to be doing that!</font>

213
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:02,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something called the Special Pursuit Corps
or whatever is coming after Akamaru!</font>

214
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:03,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

215
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Pursuit Corps should
be here soon.</font>

216
00:15:12,470 --> 00:15:15,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru will really be
in trouble if that happens!</font>

217
00:15:16,270 --> 00:15:19,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and I have to do
something before that!</font>

218
00:15:19,770 --> 00:15:22,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the time to be fighting!</font>

219
00:15:26,610 --> 00:15:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

220
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:37,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you get it, Kiba?!</font>

221
00:15:37,490 --> 00:15:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

222
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:41,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I've sighted Akamaru!</font>

223
00:15:49,130 --> 00:15:52,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba, Naruto! You guys step back!</font>

224
00:15:53,090 --> 00:15:55,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be... the Pursuit Corps is...</font>

225
00:15:58,930 --> 00:15:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sis!</font>

226
00:16:01,020 --> 00:16:05,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You gotta be... joking, right?</font>

227
00:16:06,570 --> 00:16:07,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sis!</font>

228
00:16:08,570 --> 00:16:11,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you going to do
to Akamaru with that?</font>

229
00:16:11,950 --> 00:16:14,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is medicine I received
from the Hokage.</font>

230
00:16:15,700 --> 00:16:17,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to inject it into Akamaru.</font>

231
00:16:17,990 --> 00:16:20,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then Akamaru will be saved?!</font>

232
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The probability is fifty-fifty.</font>

233
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it fails and side-effects are produced,</font>

234
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru's symptoms will
get even worse.</font>

235
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:33,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All we can do now is take
a chance on this.</font>

236
00:16:34,550 --> 00:16:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the worst happens and it fails...</font>

237
00:16:37,140 --> 00:16:38,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand, right, Kiba?</font>

238
00:16:40,470 --> 00:16:42,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Damn it...
— Even if it's only 50 percent,</font>

239
00:16:43,270 --> 00:16:45,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's a possibility that Akamaru
will be saved.</font>

240
00:16:45,770 --> 00:16:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've gotta do this!
I'll also help out, miss!</font>

241
00:16:52,690 --> 00:16:54,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

242
00:16:56,990 --> 00:16:57,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba, what about you?!</font>

243
00:16:58,490 --> 00:17:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're not going to do anything,
you're in the way, so beat it!</font>

244
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:04,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Kiba.</font>

245
00:17:11,630 --> 00:17:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just leave that coward be.</font>

246
00:17:14,010 --> 00:17:15,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're ready, right?
Let's go, Naruto!</font>

247
00:17:16,470 --> 00:17:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll save you now, Akamaru!</font>

248
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:23,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aim for the legs!
Immobilize Akamaru!</font>

249
00:17:23,600 --> 00:17:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

250
00:17:50,710 --> 00:17:53,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it's come to this,
I have no choice.</font>

251
00:17:53,170 --> 00:17:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must terminate Akamaru.</font>

252
00:17:55,470 --> 00:17:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

253
00:17:58,140 --> 00:18:00,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said stop... Akamaru.</font>

254
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

255
00:18:02,970 --> 00:18:03,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba?</font>

256
00:18:07,270 --> 00:18:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

257
00:18:14,610 --> 00:18:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you forgotten... my scent?</font>

258
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:26,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were always together from
when we were little, weren't we?</font>

259
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:41,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...</font>

260
00:18:42,300 --> 00:18:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... why... did you become like this?</font>

261
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:53,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please remember... Akamaru!</font>

262
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:56,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

263
00:18:57,740 --> 00:19:00,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Akamaru...</font>

264
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I put you through nothing but
painful experiences.</font>

265
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:12,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Akamaru...
I couldn't protect you...</font>

266
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry... Akamaru...</font>

267
00:19:22,930 --> 00:19:24,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a terrible master.</font>

268
00:19:25,430 --> 00:19:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

269
00:19:30,390 --> 00:19:33,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll... always be with you.</font>

270
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:01,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba...</font>

271
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:08,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

272
00:20:11,890 --> 00:20:14,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It really would've been touch and go</font>

273
00:20:14,860 --> 00:20:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if the Medical Corps had been
late in arriving.</font>

274
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:18,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without a doubt,</font>

275
00:20:18,650 --> 00:20:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he would've lost his life if Akamaru's
attack had hit Kiba's vital spot...</font>

276
00:20:23,910 --> 00:20:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really, it could have been
much worse.</font>

277
00:20:29,410 --> 00:20:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's wrong...</font>

278
00:20:30,660 --> 00:20:31,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba?!</font>

279
00:20:32,910 --> 00:20:35,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When he came at me with
his final attack,</font>

280
00:20:36,540 --> 00:20:39,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru just barely missed
my vital spots.</font>

281
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:47,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He drained all his remaining strength
in order to desperately control himself.</font>

282
00:20:48,850 --> 00:20:52,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru was battling desperately
with himself.</font>

283
00:20:53,850 --> 00:20:55,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's admirable, Akamaru!</font>

284
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks...</font>

285
00:20:59,900 --> 00:21:00,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru.</font>

286
